---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Contact Us | VideoEditChoice"
	description="Get in touch with VideoEditChoice for questions, suggestions, or feedback."
>
	<article class="legal-page">
		<h1>Contact Us</h1>

		<section>
			<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
			<p>
				We'd love to hear from you! Whether you have questions about video editing software,
				suggestions for new articles, or feedback about the site, feel free to reach out.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Email</h2>
			<p>
				Send us an email at: <strong>contact@videoeditchoice.com</strong>
			</p>
			<p>
				We typically respond within 2-3 business days.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>What You Can Contact Us About</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Questions about choosing video editing software</li>
				<li>Suggestions for new articles or comparisons</li>
				<li>Corrections or updates to existing content</li>
				<li>Partnerships or collaboration inquiries</li>
				<li>Technical issues with the site</li>
				<li>General feedback</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Before You Email</h2>
			<p>
				For faster answers, check if your question is already answered in our articles:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="/category/beginners">Best software for beginners</a></li>
				<li><a href="/category/comparisons">Software comparisons</a></li>
				<li><a href="/category/free-tools">Free video editing tools</a></li>
				<li><a href="/category/low-end-pc">Software for low-end PCs</a></li>
				<li><a href="/category/guides">Beginner guides</a></li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Response Time</h2>
			<p>
				We're a small team focused on creating quality content. While we read every email,
				we may not be able to respond to all messages individually, especially general questions
				already covered in our articles.
			</p>
			<p>
				We prioritize responding to:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Corrections or factual errors in articles</li>
				<li>Technical issues with the website</li>
				<li>Partnership inquiries</li>
				<li>Unique questions not covered in our content</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.legal-page {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.legal-page h1 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
	}

	.legal-page section {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.legal-page h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		color: #111;
	}

	.legal-page ul {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.legal-page li {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.legal-page strong {
		color: #0066cc;
	}
</style>
